    <title>009.伦敦KJ：犹太商人教我如何打造洋品牌收割老外搞钱</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/674439508d1233fb0ddf2e3b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">674439508d1233fb0ddf2e3b</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 25 Nov 2024 08:57:17 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>带你捕获商业世界的秘密</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎来到我的播客，大家好，我是捕梦人zoe</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天来做客的嘉宾不仅在抖音上有400多万的粉丝，而且他还把生意做到全球十几个国家，巅峰时期有800多家门店，。</span></p><span></span><p><span>他十几岁就跟随父母去迪拜闯荡，开始了他传奇的生意人生。</span></p><span></span><p><span>比如考察生意在乌克兰被绑架差点儿被撕票、跟着大篷车在阿曼边境摆地摊赚到人生第一桶金、最后回到在迪拜开餐馆结果被抓入狱，还差点做了伊朗富商的入赘女婿。</span></p><span></span><p><span>但最后让他成为一个真正生意人的，反而是在他在英国认识的一个犹太商人。</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天，我们就一起走进伦敦KJ的全球掘金故事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜时间轴｜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="104">01:44</a> 赊一条货柜开始的搞钱之路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="288">04:48</a> 傍上犹太商人大哥，学到顶级商业认知</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="748">12:28</a> 如何打造一个地道的英国品牌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1152">19:12</a> 把自己的英国品牌再开回到中东</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1730">28:50</a> 做生意如何获得核心人脉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1889">31:29</a> 少年K的奇幻漂流</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2462">41:02</a> 如何在阿曼赚第一桶金</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3024">50:24</a> 与不同国家人做生意的诀窍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3260">54:20</a> 在迪拜开中餐馆被抓</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3451">57:31</a> 温州小伙孤身勇闯英国</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3561">59:21</a> 如何成为英国最年轻的汉堡王经理</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3753">01:02:33</a> 在乌克兰被绑架捡回了一条命</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4055">01:07:35</a> 如何成为抖音百万大V</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4488">01:14:48</a> 温商的童年</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜本期嘉宾｜</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://v.douyin.com/iDrXfaqk/" data-url=