    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期采访的嘉宾是抖音商业财经领域千万粉丝大V，直男财经-刘超。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在成为抖音用户熟知的“直哥”前，他曾赌掉省台编制，赤手空拳，高调创业，最后负债百万。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目是捕梦人在抖音直播时对刘超的采访内容音频。</span></p><span></span><p><span>想更深入了解直男财经的故事，请在视频平台搜索“捕梦人”查看视频节目。</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 直男财经：从零粉丝到千万粉丝的秘诀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="934">15:34</a> 直男财经爆款视频的特点及选题标准</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1338">22:18</a> 普通人做自媒体的机会与门槛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1811">30:11</a> 选择第一份工作的重要性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2183">36:23</a> 创业之路和内容创作的要点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2680">44:40</a> 团队角色与压力缓解方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3126">52:06</a> 抖音赚钱容易吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3458">57:38</a> 如何面对掉粉困境？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3987">01:06:27</a> 抖音用户对直男财经喜好度有变化吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4443">01:14:03</a> 短视频账号的流量破圈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4820">01:20:20</a> 大学生择业困惑与专业建议</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5387">01:29:47</a> 直播带货与内容变现的共性与冲突</span></p>]]></description>
